          "message": {
            "text": "The former known-drift verdict is no longer an accepted terminal state. Chrome 147.0.7727.15 passed all 56 named DPR-1/2 rows after the color-alpha fix with source-exact verdict, unchanged four-code channel bound, unchanged eight-code positive-mutation floor, all six ownership classifications, and no structural or unexpected failures; the CI escape flag is therefore removed.",
            "markdown": "The former known-drift verdict is no longer an accepted terminal state. Chrome 147.0.7727.15 passed all 56 named DPR-1/2 rows after the color-alpha fix with source-exact verdict, unchanged four-code channel bound, unchanged eight-code positive-mutation floor, all six ownership classifications, and no structural or unexpected failures; the CI escape flag is therefore removed."
